.TH tuhexdump n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuhexdump \-  tclutils::tuhexdump  creates a classic hex/ascii dump from data or files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.nf
package require tclutils::tuhexdump
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tuhexdump::data data ?options?
::tclutils::tuhexdump::file filename ?options?
.fi
.SH OPTIONS
.IP
\fB\-width n\fR, default \fB16\fR
.IP
\fB\-offset n\fR, default \fB0\fR
.IP
\fB\-length n\fR, default \fB\-1\fR for all remaining bytes
.SH EXAMPLE
.PP
.nf
puts [::tclutils::tuhexdump::file test.pdf \-length 256]
.fi

